OL,3,GNEWSAShops closed as probe uncovers
OL,4,Acriminal activity
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree shops in Wellingborough have been
OL,7,Fclosed amid concerns of criminal
OL,8,Factivity, including around worker
OL,9,Fexploitation.
OL,11,FNorthamptonshire Police said a closure
OL,12,Forder had been issued for Euro Maxx,
OL,13,Fwhile interim closure orders were
OL,14,Fgranted for Kubus Market and Monopol.
OL,16,FSgt Curtis Chambers said police had
OL,17,Fseized "approximately #1m-worth of
OL,18,Fillicit goods, including illegal
OL,19,Ftobacco, suspected counterfeit items,
OL,20,Funregulated medicines and cannabis".
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
