OL,3,GNEWSAShops closed as probe uncovers
OL,4,Acriminal activity
OL,5,
OL,6,FElsewhere in the town, Euro Plus had
OL,7,Fits alcohol licence revoked after it
OL,8,Fwas found to be involved in the sale of
OL,9,Fillegal cigarettes.
